@base = http://localhost:3900/api
@tenant = acme
# A staff access token (auth.http → login)
@token = paste-tenant-access-token
@section = paste-section-id

### Printed sign-in slips for a section's guardians (job; the PDF link is on GET /jobs/:id).
### audience: guardians (default), students or all. Accounts whose owner chose a password are skipped.
POST {{base}}/sections/{{section}}/credential-slips
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "audience": "guardians", "includeEmailAccounts": false }
